Cambodia has amazing nature. Sokha visits a national park in the Cardamom Mountains. It's a protected area for endangered species. He walks the waterfall trail and sees many bird species. In Kampot, he joins a cave tour. Near Koh Kong, he explores the mangrove forest. Next year, he wants to try a coral reef tour.

